    {
      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "`.small-action` flex layout makes `.small-action-desc` shrink-wrap, so its floated edit/delete buttons no longer sit at the row's right edge",
      "description": "`.small-action` is now `display: flex` (line 264). Its block child `.small-action-desc` has no `flex-grow` or `width`, so as a flex item it sizes to its max-content width, including any floats inside it. Before this change it was a full-width block. The edit and delete buttons are nested inside `.small-action-desc` (`templates/components/small-action.hbs:4-9`), and `.small-action button { float: right }` (lines 306-310) floats them to the right edge of that box. For short descriptions the buttons now sit directly after the text instead of at the right edge of the 755px row (`desktop/topic-post.scss:730-733`). This affects users with `post.can_edit` or `post.can_delete`.",
      "file_ref": null,
      "category": "correctness",
      "raw_category": null,
      "location": "app/assets/stylesheets/common/base/topic-post.scss:264-310"
    },
    {
      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "Mobile `.custom-message` `margin-left: -40px` still assumes the 4em description padding this diff removed",
      "description": "The diff replaces `.small-action-desc`'s `padding: 0.5em 0 0.5em 4em` with `padding: 0 1.5%` (common/base/topic-post.scss:280). The mobile override at lines 520-522 still applies `margin-left: -40px` to `.custom-message`, which was tuned against that 4em offset. The avatar is a 45px flex item (common/base/topic-post.scss:271-274) and the description starts at about 45px. With the 1.5% padding, the message's left edge lands about 10px from the row's left edge, which is under the avatar. Before, the avatar was a float, so the message's line boxes wrapped clear of it. A flex item does not wrap around the avatar, and the avatar is vertically centered (`align-items: center`, line 265). Lines beside the avatar may now overlap its icon on mobile. This is inferred from the CSS and needs a visual check on a narrow viewport.",
      "file_ref": null,
      "category": "correctness",
      "raw_category": null,
      "location": "app/assets/stylesheets/mobile/topic-post.scss:520-522"
    }
  ],
